@host = https://localhost:7240
@token = REPLACE_WITH_A_VALID_TOKEN_FROM_THE_IMPLEMENTED_AUTH_SERVICE

### Liveness needs no database
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness needs a configured SQL Server database and applied migration
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Development OpenAPI only
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Reference read endpoint; no seed user or token issuer is included
GET {{host}}/api/v1/hr/departments?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
